Lesson 1: Introduction to Incident Response
Overview
In today's class, we'll introduce the field of Incident Response. We will cover IR processes, plans, procedures and tools used by Incident responders today.

What You’ll Learn
By the end of today’s class, you’ll be able to:

Identify the types of incidents typically escalated to incident response managers
List the team which make up a SIRT and their roles.
Identify how an incident response plan can guide the SIRT when an incident occurs.
Use the malware testing tool any.run to dynamically analyze ransomware.
